<title>USA: Tucson Electric files to form holding Co..</title>
<headline>Tucson Electric files to form holding Co..</headline>
<dateline>TUCSON, Ariz. 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tucson Electric Power Co on Friday filed an application with the Arizona Corporation Commission to form a holding company that would establish a a new corporate structure.</p>
<p>Tucson Electric said holding company status would enhance its ability to participate in the expanding electric energy business, which would benefit its customers and shareholders.</p>
<p>The proposed holding company would be named UniSource Energy Corp and would become the parent of Tucson Electric Power.</p>
